  "briefMd": "# Size the Model\n\nThree frozen runs on the same dataset with different hidden widths (dropout 0.2 fixed):\n\n| Run | Config | Final train | Final val |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **A** | 32 units | 62% | 61% |\n| **B** | 128 units | 85% | 83% |\n| **C** | 512 units | 99% | 70% |\n\nRun A plateaus low on both curves — capacity is the bottleneck. Pass when you name that run, call **underfitting**, and pick **increase_capacity**.\n",
  "submissionSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": ["overfitRun", "diagnosis", "nextKnob"],
    "properties": {
      "overfitRun": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["run-a", "run-b", "run-c"],
        "default": "run-c"
      },
      "diagnosis": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["overfitting", "underfitting", "good_fit"],
        "default": "overfitting"
      },
      "nextKnob": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "add_dropout",
          "add_regularization",
          "reduce_capacity",
          "increase_capacity",
          "increase_data",
          "none_needed"
        ],
        "default": "add_dropout"
      }
    }
  },
  "thresholds": {
    "target_run": 1,
    "diagnosis_ok": 1,
    "knob_ok": 1,
    "no_canary": 1
  },
  "budget": {
    "max_model_calls": 0,
    "max_tokens": 0,
    "max_cost_eur": 0.001,
    "wall_clock_s": 120
  },
  "gates": [
